", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 505123, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), and a SEV2 incident is open for it.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release marked healthy in production. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy release that was running, and v2.3.1-rc was only ever in staging.\n- **Result:** the service now reports healthy, with the error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** the SEV2 incident describes the failure, the rollback to v2.3.0, and the next steps. The tool reported that the incident was created once, so I did not open a second one.\n\nBefore anyone redeploys v2.3.1, its failure needs investigating. Because v2.3.1 has never been healthy in production, redeploying it will require change-manager approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01LgEseJ11eenVp7epDCtfVf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01UiQevP8D2jtiRdj8zECgRc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy production release, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_011ZSL4rhph7ThVzbQrtVo87", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.93}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "to